@startuml SD-3b
!include ../_style.iuml
title SD-3b (Software level, CSMS) — Replayed StartTransaction is recorded only once (ADR-0010)\nPrecondition: Charge Point reconnected and replays a stored StartTransaction · System view: AD-3 · State: STM-1
footer Owner: Ngô Văn Minh Trí (WP2) · v2.0 · 01/11/2026 · names = code (apps/csms/src) · left gate = Charge Point [OCPP 1.6J, WSS]

participant "«component»\n<u>:OcppServer</u>" as OS
participant "«component»\n<u>:ReplayDetector</u>" as RD
participant "«component»\n<u>:OcppHandlers</u>" as H
participant "«component»\n<u>:SessionsService</u>" as S
participant "«component»\n<u>:ReconciliationService</u>" as R

[-> OS ++ : StartTransaction {connectorId, idTag, meterStart, timestamp}
OS -> RD ++ : classify(cpTimestamp, receivedAt, epochOpenedAt) : ReplayVerdict
RD --> OS -- : replayed = true
OS -> OS : log frame in ocpp_message_log
OS -> H ++ : dispatch(StartTransaction, params, ctx)
H -> S ++ : onStartTransaction(req, ctx)
S -> S : look up session by natural key\n(Charge Point, connector, start time)
alt no session with this key
  S -> S : create session, new transactionId
  hnote over S : {session.status = active}
else session already exists
  S -> R ++ : recordDuplicate(sessionId, frame)
  R --> S --
  note right : no status change
end
S --> H -- : transactionId
H --> OS -- : {transactionId, idTagInfo.status = Accepted}
[<-- OS -- : StartTransaction.conf (same transactionId)
note over OS, R : The Charge Point always gets the same transactionId, so its later MeterValues and StopTransaction attach to the one session.
@enduml
